sand_grain_roughness:
Perform dimensional analysis for sand-grain roughness parameterization to derive the dimensionless relationship governing the normalized equivalent sand-grain roughness (denoted as ks/Ra).
This analysis uses ONLY the following 8 input physical quantities:
the arithmetic mean roughness, Ra;
the mean peak-to-valley height, Sx;
the mean roughness height, k_avg;
the root-mean-square roughness, k_rms;
the skewness of the surface-height distribution, Sk;
the kurtosis of the surface-height distribution, Ku;
the effective surface slope, ES;
the surface porosity, Po.
